We can calculate the change in Gibbs entropy for the reaction (ΔG<sub>f</sub>) using Hess'Law:

ΔG<sub>rx</sub> = Σ(n<sub>f</sub> * ΔG<sub>f</sub>(s<sub>f</sub>)) - Σ(n<sub>f</sub> * ΔG<sub>f</sub>(s<sub>s</sub>))

